# Ralph agent instructions (Cursor)

One iteration — fresh context. Read files, do ONE story, update state.

1. Read `scripts/ralph/prd.json` and `scripts/ralph/progress.txt`
2. Pick highest priority story where `passes` is false
3. Implement only that story
4. Run `py scripts/ralph/validate.py`
5. Mark story `passes: true`, append to `progress.txt`
6. Output `<promise>COMPLETE</promise>` only when all stories pass
